# The dev image copies nothing — the source arrives as a bind mount. The
# production image copies the whole context, so this list is now load-bearing in
# a second way: what it excludes is what `go build` cannot see.
#
# Deliberately short. `**/testdata` would be the obvious next line and it is a
# trap: internal/httpx/assets carries the OpenAPI document that go:embed puts in
# the binary, and a filter wide enough to catch one is wide enough to catch the
# other — a build that succeeds locally and fails in the container.
tmp
Dockerfile.dev
.air.toml
